{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23549","headline":"代诸妓赠送周判官 · 白居易","name":"代诸妓赠送周判官","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"妓筵今夜别姑苏，客櫂明朝向镜湖。\n莫泛扁舟寻范蠡，且随五马觅罗敷。\n兰亭月破能回否，娃馆秋凉却到无。\n好与使君爲老伴，归来休染白髭须。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23549.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23549","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}